{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WHAT IS STARGROUND?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Starground</strong> is a top-down automation dungeon crawler combo. Alternate between gathering and refining resources on your home planet, and venturing across space to fight through action roguelite-inspired dungeons. How you split your time is entirely up to you! There's no right way to play the game, and any path will progress the story.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MULTIPLAYER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starground was built up with multiplayer from the beginning. Experience what Starground has to offer as a full co-operative experience with as many friends as you'd like. Invite your friends to work towards common goals, or divide and conquer each part of the game. If multiplayer isn't your thing though, you can play alone in single player too! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AUTOMATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop and maximize an island of resources through automation. Work your way through a research tree filled with all sorts of unique machines and solutions to your logistical needs. Start humble by mining resources by hand and smelting manually, but soon build up to a formidable factory that can tackle anything you can throw at it. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2793380/extras/870bdbcb5fbbc79411cd92f6f6234a72.poster.avif?t=1750981533\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2793380/extras/870bdbcb5fbbc79411cd92f6f6234a72.webm?t=1750981533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2793380/extras/870bdbcb5fbbc79411cd92f6f6234a72.mp4?t=1750981533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DUNGEONS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're not into automation, or need to wait for your factory, then venture to other places in the solar system to explore and crawl your way through a variety of dungeons. Battle enemies, avoid obstacles, kill bosses, and reap the rewards of your effort. Take resources from dungeons back to your factory,  or use rare loot to make yourself stronger and craft modular weapons. Make a spear, dual-bladed sword, or maybe a gun on a stick. The choice is yours. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2793380/extras/77612526f694e915917a58ce30f1b933.poster.avif?t=1750981533\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2793380/extras/77612526f694e915917a58ce30f1b933.webm?t=1750981533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2793380/extras/77612526f694e915917a58ce30f1b933.mp4?t=1750981533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be sure to add Starground to your <u>Wishlist</u>!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2793380?t=1750981533","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2793380/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750981533","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2793380/b072707cd38dfba6612dcce2f369cb380b5145cc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750981533","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2793380/b072707cd38dfba6612dcce2f369cb380b5145cc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750981533","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3018040,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>ROADMAP</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2793380/extras/7944338367bf1e2c664f188b96c7ddcc.avif?t=1750981533\" width=800 height=1578 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(<i>This is a tentative roadmap as of v0.13 and is subject to change</i>)</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WHAT IS STARGROUND?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Starground</strong> is a top-down automation dungeon crawler combo. Alternate between gathering and refining resources on your home planet, and venturing across space to fight through action roguelite-inspired dungeons. How you split your time is entirely up to you! There's no right way to play the game, and any path will progress the story.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MULTIPLAYER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starground was built up with multiplayer from the beginning. Experience what Starground has to offer as a full co-operative experience with as many friends as you'd like. Invite your friends to work towards common goals, or divide and conquer each part of the game. If multiplayer isn't your thing though, you can play alone in single player too! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AUTOMATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop and maximize an island of resources through automation. Work your way through a research tree filled with all sorts of unique machines and solutions to your logistical needs. Start humble by mining resources by hand and smelting manually, but soon build up to a formidable factory that can tackle anything you can throw at it. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2793380/extras/870bdbcb5fbbc79411cd92f6f6234a72.poster.avif?t=1750981533\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2793380/extras/870bdbcb5fbbc79411cd92f6f6234a72.webm?t=1750981533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2793380/extras/870bdbcb5fbbc79411cd92f6f6234a72.mp4?t=1750981533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DUNGEONS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're not into automation, or need to wait for your factory, then venture to other places in the solar system to explore and crawl your way through a variety of dungeons. Battle enemies, avoid obstacles, kill bosses, and reap the rewards of your effort. Take resources from dungeons back to your factory,  or use rare loot to make yourself stronger and craft modular weapons. Make a spear, dual-bladed sword, or maybe a gun on a stick. The choice is yours. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2793380/extras/77612526f694e915917a58ce30f1b933.poster.avif?t=1750981533\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2793380/extras/77612526f694e915917a58ce30f1b933.webm?t=1750981533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2793380/extras/77612526f694e915917a58ce30f1b933.mp4?t=1750981533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be sure to add Starground to your <u>Wishlist</u>!</p>","developers":["Big Boy Games"],"dlc":[3735710],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2793380/e3c1879e159d74ea614ffbc72fbadbcf687f55db/header.jpg?t=1750981533","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Linux<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Vulkan Support<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 200 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Linux<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Vulkan Support<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2793380/1355126068/33d73efc46d3e379fe97e7e6b1f6b72f939d0ec7/1750900718/dash_av1.mpd?t=1747415562","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2793380/1355126068/33d73efc46d3e379fe97e7e6b1f6b72f939d0ec7/1750900718/dash_h264.mpd?t=1747415562","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2793380/1355126068/33d73efc46d3e379fe97e7e6b1f6b72f939d0ec7/1750900718/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1747415562","id":257140642,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257140642/movie480.mp4?t=1747415562","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257140642/movie_max.mp4?t=1747415562"},"name":"Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akam